mark draft

# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0038): it declared a top-level `get`, and names are package-global, so it shadowed list
# `get` wherever it was built. Nothing loads it; `clock` reads the time through `current-time`.

# The current time. Forwards to the linked clock runtime shim. Internal: reached only through the public clock API.

dock load
  load <global:clock>, name clock

task get
  take
    precise
    like boolean
    fall false
  like number

  fork test
    hook test
      read precise
    hook hold
      send back
        call clock/precise
    hook miss
      send back
        call clock/now
